  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Act on emails in processes",
    "splashDescription": "This inbound connector enables you to connect a Camunda process to a Microsoft 365 Outlook account and react to incoming emails. It exposes the rich filter language provided by the OData Graph API. You can authenticate with client credentials, a refresh token, or a bearer token.",
